        {
         "@type": "meaningComprehension",
         "comprehends": [
          "copies/yb187qn0290.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "pencil, single line, steeply slanted; read after deshearing. Crops 3 and 4 blank. Crop 2 shows the printed leader label 'WELTE-MIGNON No. 1246 / Sonate (Mondschein) I. und II. Teil / L. v. Beethoven', so the pencil number disagrees with the label. In the date the '1' of '13' is a short tick that could instead be a separator, which would leave '9.4.3'; the '3' could also be a '2'. The trailing '74.' is legible but unexplained."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
